      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture. The test creates an `XmlStreamWriter` wrapping a null `OutputStream`, writes an XML prolog start (`\"<?xml\"`), then tries to append a large `CharBuffer` — which triggers encoding detection that ultimately tries to create an `OutputStreamWriter` with the null stream, causing a `NullPointerException`. Let me write the improved version.The improved test compiled successfully."
